        V1S["Ships: rules-first engine + dual wage base, ECR generator - EV-035,<br/>ESI computation and upload, PT for gazette-sourced design-partner states,<br/>Form 138 Q1-Q3, six registers + wage slip - EV-053,<br/>core HR, ADMS receiver, watcher, bundled AI + attribution"]:::phase
        V1F["Fenced until the blocker clears - section 05.7<br/>Form 138 Q4 + Form 130 Part B - EV-046<br/>ECR arrear returns - EV-043<br/>state PT/LWF slabs not yet gazette-sourced<br/>ESI after 22 Nov 2026 - section 06.9<br/>ESIC upload template until captured from the portal<br/>attended submission - counsel, section 23"]:::fence
    end

    G1{{"v1 exit, all required<br/>40+ paying tenants live 6+ months<br/>one full cycle - Q4 only once the format is released<br/>on-time rate 98%+, every miss root-caused<br/>four COGS lines instrumented - EV-088<br/>10+ mid-year migrations, zero breaks"}}:::gate

    subgraph V2["v2 - Scales the filing: 200-1,999 private"]
        direction TB
        V2S["Adds: multi-establishment + group entities,<br/>all-states PT/LWF dataset - a differentiator, EV-031/032,<br/>SSO/SCIM, CA console productised,<br/>metered SKUs as a separate revenue line"]:::phase
    end

    G2{{"v2 exit, all required<br/>5+ paying 200-999 tenants, SLA 98%+<br/>SSO/SCIM + multi-state GA and audited<br/>permanent statutory desk<br/>ISO 27001 held 12+ months"}}:::gate

    subgraph VIS["Vision - Files at any scale: 2,000+ incl. regulated"]
        direction TB
        VS["Self-host as a priced compliance SKU, residency matrix GA,<br/>full IR tooling; RBI entities materiality-gated - EV-087;<br/>PSU/BFSI only on documentary gates - section 05.3"]:::phase
    end

    M0 -.-> PRE
    PRE --> V1
    V1 --> G1
